.TH NAME 1.SH NAMEname, rndname \- invent pronounceable names.SH SYNOPSIS\fBname\fR[count].br\fBrndname\fR[count].SH DESCRIPTIONName generators for the characters of a tabletop game.\fBname\fRdeals vowels and consonants in turn, with the letter frequencies of aScrabble set, so the names come out pronounceable and fairly plain:\fBOpakov\fR,\fR\fBEquf\fR.\fR\fBrndname\fRis the earlier version, with every letter equally likely, so its namesare more exotic:\fBQeqx\fR,\fR\fBTehow\fR.\fREach prints as many as you ask for, one to a line..SH NOTESBoth need Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR